{"id":"n27765-1-7","stage":2,"title":"지능 · 智能","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27765-1-7-1","ko":"이 로봇은 인공 지능을 가진 로봇이야.","zh":"这个机器人是拥有人工智能的机器人哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"로봇은","meaning":"机器人","explanation":"로봇：机器人；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"로봇","audio":"/audio/7c3bf7bf31cbc94c5804.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15538","senseId":"1","lemma":"로봇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인공","meaning":"人工","explanation":"인공：人工","readings":[{"term":"인공","audio":"/audio/9a01453d64bad1c60c5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25007","senseId":"2","lemma":"인공","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지능을","meaning":"智能","explanation":"지능：智能；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지능","audio":"/audio/b4a5d8f8a46b58748e3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27765","senseId":"1","lemma":"지능","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가진","meaning":"拥有，具有，持有","explanation":"가지다：拥有，具有，持有；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65234","senseId":"5","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"로봇이야.","meaning":"机器人","explanation":"로봇：机器人；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"로봇","audio":"/audio/7c3bf7bf31cbc94c5804.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15538","senseId":"1","lemma":"로봇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"7c3bf7bf31cbc94c","term":"로봇","zh":"机器人","audio":"/audio/7c3bf7bf31cbc94c5804.mp3","entryId":"15538","definition":"模仿人的整体或某个身体部位而制成的，能够模仿人类活动或工作的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"9a01453d64bad1c6","term":"인공","zh":"人工","audio":"/audio/9a01453d64bad1c60c5f.mp3","entryId":"25007","definition":"非自然的、以人的力量制造出来的东西。","pronunciation":["인공"]},{"id":"b4a5d8f8a46b5874","term":"지능","zh":"智能","audio":"/audio/b4a5d8f8a46b58748e3b.mp3","entryId":"27765","definition":"理解并应对事物或状况的，充满智慧的适应能力。","pronunciation":["지능"]},{"id":"f3b684d86e5485ed","term":"가지다","zh":"拥有，具有，持有","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3","entryId":"65234","definition":"具备可以发挥的效力或能力等。","pronunciation":["가지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/73ebb80a43afaf72b13e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27765-1-7-2","ko":"정말 사람처럼 물건을 잡는구나.","zh":"它抓东西的样子真的和人一模一样呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람처럼","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；처럼：表示相似：“像……一样”。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물건을","meaning":"东西，物品，物件","explanation":"물건：东西，物品，物件；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"물건","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66247","senseId":"1","lemma":"물건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잡는구나.","meaning":"抓，揪","explanation":"잡다：抓，揪；는구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"잡다","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70378","senseId":"1","lemma":"잡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"df279371093362d8","term":"물건","zh":"东西，物品，物件","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3","entryId":"66247","definition":"具有一定形状的某种物质。","pronunciation":["물건"]},{"id":"b8cc8df3de72c173","term":"잡다","zh":"抓，揪","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3","entryId":"70378","definition":"用手握住不放。","pronunciation":["잡따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a7b3703f64b7c453aaa4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.413,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=27765","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":81,"sequenceScore":2.2397,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这个机器人是拥有人工智能的机器人哦。","它抓东西的样子真的和人一模一样呢。","那些黄色的小鸡真漂亮，对吧？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这个机器人是拥有人工智能的机器人哦。","它抓东西的样子真的和人一模一样呢。","那些黄色的小鸡真漂亮，对吧？"],"answer":1}]}
